      "message": "Objects are copied with no expiry cutoff; the existing-cruft branch at `:583-585` ignores `expired`. No per-object cruft expiry exists, so cruft never ages out. Reuse `getExpireDate()`/`gc.pruneExpire` and drop expired objects via a closure from recent objects — a flat per-object filter drops older deps of retained recent commits.",
