      "side": 1,
      "message": "First-copy-wins: `putIfAbsent` plus the `ids.contains` skip drops later copies; native keeps the max (`pack-objects.c:4204`). An old packed copy plus a newer loose copy records the old mtime and removes the loose copy; native then prunes it early from JGit\u0027s output. Merge duplicates with max and let recent loose copies contribute first — swapping `putIfAbsent` for `merge` alone isn\u0027t enough while `ids.contains` skips them.",
